{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"components-note","type":"text","x":0,"y":-180,"width":1900,"height":120,"text":"## Implemented compute datapath\n\n[[Stereo SAD Datapath]] composes packed storage/alignment and [[SAD Search Backend]]. One engine is shown as the replicated lane; the comparator is a child of the backend, not an extra instance. Controllers/transport remain in [[Project Plan]]."},
		{"id":"left-row","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":300,"height":220,"text":"## Left packed row store · RTL\n\nIndependent four-pixel loads → K-row column L[x].\n[[Packed Circular Row Buffer]]"},
		{"id":"right-row","type":"text","x":0,"y":340,"width":300,"height":220,"text":"## Right packed row store · same RTL\n\nIndependent four-pixel loads → K-row column R[x].\n[[Packed Circular Row Buffer]]"},
		{"id":"left-delay","type":"text","x":380,"y":0,"width":300,"height":220,"text":"## Left column delay · RTL\n\nRegister one whole column and valid. Match the right cache sampling edge; payload holds during bubbles.\n[[Left Column Delay]]"},
		{"id":"right-cache","type":"text","x":380,"y":340,"width":300,"height":220,"text":"## Right-column cache · RTL\n\nShift whole columns on valid input. Q[d]=R[x−d]; each tap has warmup validity.\n[[Right Column Shift Register]]"},
		{"id":"engine-0","type":"text","x":760,"y":170,"width":300,"height":240,"text":"## Single SAD engine · RTL\n\nOne already-aligned disparity lane: column calculator + horizontal cost history.\n[[Single SAD Engine]]\n[[SAD Engine Blocks.canvas|Inside the engine]]"},
		{"id":"bank-plan","type":"file","x":1140,"y":170,"width":350,"height":340,"file":"Accelerator/SAD Search Backend.md"},
		{"id":"tree","type":"text","x":1570,"y":170,"width":330,"height":240,"text":"## Minimum comparator tree · RTL\n\nReduce aligned valid (SAD, d) candidates. Lower cost wins; equal cost selects lower d.\n[[Minimum Comparator Tree]]"}
	],
